    E.append(ent("review", "fable5", "2026-09-26", "", R15 + "opus48_FALLBACK_r15p2.md",
                 "[NOT A SEAT ANSWER] The flagship's first answer on repair 15's pass 2 was written by claude-opus-4-8 "
